</section>

<!-- ══ BRAND STORY ══ -->
<section class="pab-section" aria-labelledby="pab-story-heading">
  <div class="pab-inner">
    <div class="pab-story">

      <!-- Visual -->
      <div class="pab-story__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <img
          class="pab-story__visual-img"
          src="https://www.petaloons.com/cdn/shop/files/1.0.png?v=1777115848"
          alt="Dog wearing a festive lehenga by Petaloons — India's #1 dog fashion brand"
          loading="lazy"
          width="480"
          height="600"
        >
        <div class="pab-story__badge">🇮🇳 Proudly Made in India</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text -->
      <div class="pab-story__content">
        <div class="pab-section-label">📖 Our Story</div>
        <h2 class="pab-section-title" id="pab-story-heading">We started with one simple belief</h2>
        <p class="pab-story__body">
          <strong>Dogs are family.</strong> And family deserves to look good at every celebration.
        </p>
        <p class="pab-story__body">
          Petaloons was born in 2020 when we noticed a huge gap — Indian dog parents wanted outfits for festivals, weddings and Diwali, but there was nothing that truly felt <strong>Indian, premium and safe</strong> for their pets.
        </p>
        <p class="pab-story__body">
          We set out to change that. Working with local artisans, we started handcrafting
          <strong>dog lehengas, dog sherwanis, dog t-shirts</strong> and accessories — all made from
          pet-safe, skin-friendly fabrics tested by real dog parents.
        </p>
        <p class="pab-story__body">
          Today, Petaloons is India's most loved dog fashion brand, trusted by over
          <strong>10,000 pet parents</strong> across every city in India. 🐾
        </p>

        <!-- Milestones -->
        <div class="pab-story__milestones" aria-label="Brand milestones">
          <div class="pab-milestone">
            <div class="pab-milestone__year" aria-hidden="true">2020</div>
            <div class="pab-milestone__text">
              <h3>Petaloons Founded</h3>
              <p>First handcrafted dog lehenga collection launched to overwhelming response.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pab-milestone">
            <div class="pab-milestone__year" aria-hidden="true">2022</div>
            <div class="pab-milestone__text">
              <h3>Reached 1,000+ Customers</h3>
              <p>Dog sherwanis and wedding collections launched. Expanded to pan-India delivery.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pab-milestone">
